# Clusters

P1 funds dedicated partitions at three Danish HPC facilities, each matched to a research profile.
We help run them as well: the P1 compute coordinator holds admin on the systems and works alongside
each provider's HPC team, so the service stays fit for research rather than drifting from what
researchers need. The pages below call them clusters, which is how you will experience them day to
day; formally each one is a P1 partition on the provider's system. Use the table below to find the
one that fits your project, then follow its page for access and usage instructions.

